WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.020
Charles Arbor?

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:07.440
That's who Professor Celia is marrying?

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.280
Well, it is your quintessential 
marriage of convenience.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.030
By which you mean...

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.900
In the last conflict,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.040
the Kingdom of Beltrum suffered a 
crushing defeat by the Proxia Empire.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:22.100
Thanks to the actions of 
the House of Duke Arbor,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.680
we just barely managed to 
commence negotiations for peace,

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.990
but the power and authority 
of the royal family was lost.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.370
When Duke Huguenot's faction was 
made to take responsibility,

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:33.050
they fled the royal capital.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.200
The House of Duke Arbor has 
rallied their momentum,

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.180
and what they have chosen in 
order to once more gain strength

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.950
is the House of Count Claire.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:48.860
Does Professor Celia... no, does the House of 
Count Claire desire this political marriage?

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.690
I don't know.

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:53.410
I don't have such detailed information.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.690
What will you do, Haruto?

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.590
The wedding ceremony is tomorrow.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:08.400
Before it happens, I want to see 
Professor Celia and ask her in person.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:09.670
Yes.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.900
But the professor is in the castle.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.560
Their defenses will be even 
tighter than the Academy.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.750
Then I'll use my spirit form and investigate.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:23.140
A spirit in spirit form is 
a mass of od and mana...

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.750
Something inside the castle may be set 
to detect suspicious magical power.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.540
Will you be all right?

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:31.730
I can visually perceive barriers 
that are made to detect magic.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.090
I see.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.190
O-Oh, but Aishia, you and 
the professor haven't—

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.150
I know what Celia looks like.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.120
I'm counting on you, then.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.930
Yes, leave it to me.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.180
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.180
Seirei Gensouki

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:20.030
<b>Silver Bride</b>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:20.030
<b>Silver Bride</b>

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.370
I'm so sorry, Celia.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.070
I just haven't been able to come to see you.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:31.300
And now... it's already the 
night before the wedding.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:35.910
It couldn't be helped, Father. 
You're busy with official matters.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.570
Count Claire...

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.520
No, I suppose I should be calling 
you "Father" now, shouldn't I?

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:44.320
The preparations for the ceremony 
are complete. Please set your mind at ease.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.060
I heard that the ceremony 
will be a large event.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.150
Yes.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:51.260
This is a wedding between 
our House of Duke Arbor

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.840
and the House of Count Claire, after all.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.720
We'll be able to show those 
inside and outside the kingdom

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.920
that the power of the 
Kingdom of Beltrum is solid.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:03:59.840
That said,

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.900
the state of affairs within the 
kingdom is still disordered.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.870
Security will be flawless, I expect?

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.440
Of course!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.350
The Knights of the Royal Guard, 
the Mage Corps, and others...

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.350
I've gathered our kingdom's very best.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.670
Then I do feel more at ease. However...

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:17.110
I suppose worrying about everything 
is part of parental love.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.910
Thank you, Father.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:25.890
Instead of you worrying for us, 
Father, we are worried about you!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:29.860
For some time, strange rumors 
have been flowing from the royal court.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.390
That you and a portion of the nobles

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:36.880
have been secretly in contact with 
Duke Huguenot, who fled the kingdom.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.160
That slander is completely unfounded.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.880
Yes, I know.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.910
But it is true that trust 
in you has been shaken.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.190
I would never betray this kingdom.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:51.390
Father, please don't worry.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:56.650
My marriage to Celia is partly 
to help protect your standing.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:02.020
The House of Duke Arbor would never 
abandon the House of Count Claire.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.660
And I am very grateful for that.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.010
Father, soon we'll have

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:15.210
you serve as commander and director 
of the House of Duke Arbor.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.080
That's all right with you, isn't it?

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:19.070
<i>That sounds like a threat...</i>

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:23.310
<i>My dear Celia, I am truly sorry.</i>

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:26.830
<i>If I were better at maneuvering...</i>

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:32.450
I understand. I will do everything in 
my power to fulfill this responsibility.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.970
Well, then! To the peace and 
prosperity of both our houses!

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:40.800
And to this beautiful bride.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.320
To the both of you.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:47.340
We are in your care, Lord Charles.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:50.690
Father and I will both dedicate 
ourselves entirely to this.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.080
No, it is I who am grateful to you.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.830
I look forward to the 
wedding ceremony tomorrow.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.270
Yes.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.340
<i>The defenses are very strong,
 just as I thought.</i>

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:08.130
<i>Perhaps it's in preparation for tomorrow.</i>

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.760
<i>Haruto, I've found where Celia is.</i>

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.580
Good. Where is she?

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.710
<i>She's outside the palace.</i>

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:17.810
<i>Start at the main gate. On the left, 
a fair ways in, there's a large building.</i>

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.680
Understood. I'll head there now.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:31.660
<i>It's been such a long time 
since I've seen Father,</i>

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.760
<i>but we weren't able to speak 
as parent and child at all.</i>

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:40.080
<i>Still, with this, Father and the 
House of Claire will be all right.</i>

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.560
<i>All that's left...</i>

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.920
<i>is for me to become that man's 
property for the rest of my life.</i>

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.010
<i>Here at the very end...</i>

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.220
<i>I wish I could have seen him again.</i>

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.100
For certain, absolutely certain, understand?

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.900
Stay safe...

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.650
until you return, all right?

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.650
<i>I think probably...</i>

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.280
<i>the feelings I have for Rio are...</i>

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.090
Who's there?

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:29.550
Quiet.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.800
It's me, Professor Celia.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.770
Rio.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:34.740
What?

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.550
Oh.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.810
It's been a long time.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.060
R-Rio?

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.080
Yes.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.520
Is it really you, Rio?

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.020
I've returned, just as I promised.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.530
Though it's taken me four years to do it.

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.400
Rio!

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.200
It is you.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.850
P-Professor...

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:02.710
Yes...

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.580
You're really here. It isn't a dream.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.900
Professor, I've missed you.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.210
Yes, as I have you!

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:12.970
All this time...

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:13.970
Yes.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.330
Rio...

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.310
You've gotten quite a bit taller.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.040
You haven't changed very 
much at all, Professor.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.650
I-I've grown a little more womanly!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.480
Yes.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:29.480
You have always been beautiful, 
but you've grown even more lovely.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.690
There you go, saying things
 like that again!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:38.910
You've grown dashing, Rio.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:42.450
Strong and gallant.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.340
Thank you very much.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:53.270
I-I'm so glad you came back safe and sound.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:54.730
Wait...

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:56.540
How did you get here?

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:58.140
You couldn't have snuck in, could you?

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.010
Yes, well...

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:06.010
Oh, right! Did you make it to the 
Yagumo region? Where else did you go?

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:08.210
I want to hear everything!

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:09.640
Y-Yes...

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.020
Oh, wait.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.320
Would you like some tea? Let's have some.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.020
We often had tea together, 
just the two of us, didn't we?

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:18.450
Yes, we did.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.540
Since then, I've always 
had tea alone, you know?

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:25.400
Professor... You're getting 
married, aren't you?

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:29.170
I've heard that your groom is Charles Arbor.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.550
Y-Yes.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.740
That's right.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.790
I know it's rude to ask so suddenly, but...

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.420
Is this wedding something 
you want, Professor?

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:43.060
I am sorry to ask something like this.

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:46.940
But when I heard that the 
wedding ceremony is tomorrow...

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:51.230
This wedding is something 
I have agreed to, of course.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:54.990
Even though the person 
you're marrying... is Charles Arbor?

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.990
He's someone you have an ill-fated 
connection with, isn't he?

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:03.420
I thought perhaps

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:06.200
this might have something to do with 
the circumstances of your family.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.210
No. I am of age, after all.

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:13.590
I can't think only of my research forever.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.260
Really?

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.280
Yes!

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:22.080
And in spite of appearances, Lord Charles 
is chivalrous and kind toward women!

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:23.970
Professor...

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.920
Then, will you marry me instead, Rio?

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:32.480
Or will you take me somewhere and
live the rest of your life with me?

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.170
I... uh...

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.140
Just kidding.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:37.950
What?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:41.050
I'm sorry. Please forget all of that.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:42.330
Professor...

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.860
Rio, you should leave.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.750
We haven't finished talking yet.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.420
You can't stay. The people who
 look after me will be here soon.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.790
I have an early day tomorrow, 
and there are a lot of preparations left.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.220
I'm glad I was able to see 
you before the ceremony.

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.090
Oh...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.090
And don't come to the ceremony. 
It's too embarrassing.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.100
Now, then, hurry up and go.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:07.190
Be careful not to get caught as you leave.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:11.180
I'll close that door and give 
you twenty seconds to go.

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:12.590
Go on.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:15.860
If you don't hurry up and leave, I'll scream.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:17.840
Come on!

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:28.140
One, two, three, four, five, six...

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:35.570
<i>Thank you, Rio...</i>

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.800
<i>for coming back, just as you promised.</i>

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.350
<i>It made me truly happy.</i>

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:44.580
<i>But I can't let you get caught up in this.</i>

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.970
<i>Bye-bye, Rio.</i>

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:50.680
Haruto?

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.370
I wasn't able to find out her true feelings.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:54.810
What will you do?

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:56.480
I don't know.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:01.330
But I want to know a little more 
about what's motivating this wedding.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.970
I will help you.

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:04.570
Sorry.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.120
Why are you apologizing?

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.630
Because all I do is have you help me, Aishia.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:13.830
I believe I've told you. I will 
always be at your side, Haruto.

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:17.790
If you need me, you can come to me any time.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:19.860
Thank you.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.280
Fall in!

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:25.690
Sir!

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:27.390
Right face!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.940
Lord Charles, I have brought Sir Reiss.

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:31.390
Ah!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.350
Sir Reiss!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:37.150
Allow me to offer congratulations 
on this, the event of your wedding.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:39.350
Thank you so much for coming!

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:43.940
With our relationship? 
I am delighted to attend.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.720
Yes, thank you!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.660
When did you arrive in our royal capital?

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.910
I've just arrived.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:53.830
If I'd known earlier that you'd be staying, 
I'd have provided a proper welcome!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.080
No, please don't trouble yourself.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.630
Though we are officially at peace 
with the Kingdom of Beltrum,

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.900
we two are from enemy countries.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:06.370
If you are too friendly with me, I am sure 
there are some who would not be amused.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:07.780
I see.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:10.850
So this time, I will keep my visit quiet.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.070
I am touched by your consideration.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:13.940
It's fine.

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:17.140
But once the ceremony is over,
 please come to my home!

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:20.330
Tonight is your first night together.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.360
I will visit another day.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.850
Oh, well, I...

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:28.500
To take such trouble and to be 
so considerate is quite, well...

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.500
<i>I sense a spirit.</i>

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.780
<i>It's quite a powerful one.</i>

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:30.620
Sir Reiss...

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.250
Is something wrong?

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.160
No, nothing.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.770
I will go to the ceremony hall
 early and wait there.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.990
Allow me to send someone
 to show you the way.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:43.130
You there! Show Sir Reiss to the ceremony hall.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:42.200
I am honored.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:43.850
Sir!

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:46.150
Be sure to show him every courtesy.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:46.150
<i>It's disappeared.</i>

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:46.890
Yes, sir.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.390
<i>Everything is fine.</i>

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.460
<i>I am a doll.</i>

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.380
<i>I have no feelings. I am just a doll.</i>

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:00.930
Celia...

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.400
Please come out here a moment.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.900
Yes, I'll be right out!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.480
Oh, my...

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:13.680
You look m-magnificent, Celia! Truly beautiful!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.410
Thank you very much, Lord Charles.

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:19.280
Very nice... Truly wonderful!

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:20.670
Even better than I'd imagined!

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.310
Are you nervous?

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:27.120
Don't worry. I am here.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:27.930
Yes.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.680
And, you see, I thought it might 
help you feel more relaxed,

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.630
so I've brought my wives.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:35.100
You should take this opportunity 
to become friends.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.340
Tenasina, take care of the rest, won't you?

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:39.690
Leave it to me.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.840
I am his first wife, Tenasina.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.280
There is something I would like to 
make clear from the very beginning.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:49.650
Y-Yes?

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:57.640
Normally you, the daughter of a count, 
would be superior to us in social standing.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:00.830
But once you have married Lord Charles,

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:05.530
as his seventh wife, your place 
amongst us is at the very bottom.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.670
Of course. I understand.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:11.910
I will not allow any impertinent behavior.

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:13.300
It shall be as you say.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:17.200
I am inexperienced and inept, 
but I hope you will look on me kindly.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.350
Your complexion looks terrible.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.310
You are going to be a bride of the 
House of Duke Arbor, you know.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.530
Smile more brightly.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.340
Y-Yes.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:29.960
Well, I suppose that will do.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.590
L-Lady Celia!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.460
What is all this noise?

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:36.220
Her Highness, Princess Christina, 
First Princess of the Realm is here!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.200
Princess Christina?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.620
Let her through right away!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.490
Yes, my lady!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.820
Who gave you leave to—

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:43.960
My deepest apologies!

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:49.450
But would it not shame the House of Duke Arbor
 to keep Princess Christina waiting?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.870
Princess Christina!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.430
What an honor to see you!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:56.000
I am sorry for arriving 
so suddenly, with no prior notice.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.890
Please, don't trouble yourselves for me.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:01.640
Thank you so much for 
coming, Princess Christina!

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.660
My!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.850
You look beautiful, Professor!

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:08.150
That wedding dress suits 
you wonderfully well!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.150
Th-Thank you very much.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:15.390
Princess Christina, please come 
inside and rest at your leisure!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:18.960
I was hoping to speak with my 
former teacher, Professor Celia, in private.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:22.020
Oh! P-P-Please forgive my impertinence!

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:24.520
W-Well then, we will take our leave.

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:27.940
Now, ladies, let us go!

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:35.430
Professor, I've come to offer congratulations
 in place of my mother and father.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.270
Thank you very much.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.680
You truly are beautiful, Professor!

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:45.990
I-I accept your words of praise 
with a heart full of gratitude.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.330
I'm glad.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.190
What?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:52.560
Your complexion looks a little 
better than it did earlier.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.130
O-Oh...

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:58.450
Did those individuals say 
something unpleasant to you?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:02.990
No. I was just so nervous yesterday 
that I didn't sleep well.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.210
I think that might be the cause.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.420
I see.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.490
It really has been a while, hasn't it?

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.470
Princess Christina, I'm so
 happy to see you again!

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.020
So am I!

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:20.510
It's thanks to you, Professor, that I'm 
finally able to be outside like this.

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:24.480
For so long, I had been confined in the palace.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:28.000
The scrutiny of Duke Arbor's faction 
is quite stringent, isn't it?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.980
In my case, the inadequacy of the 
royal family is the cause of it.

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.990
I believe Flora feels the same.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:40.590
When Duke Huguenot fled 
the kingdom with Princess Flora ...

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.740
I'm sure it must have been painful.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:47.370
It made me see that all faith in the 
power of the royal family had been lost.

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:51.840
And the ill effects of that have 
resulted in your wedding, Professor.

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:55.630
I am truly sorry for all of this!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.310
P-Princess Christina!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.520
This wedding is something I decided upon!

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:01.640
Why are you apologizing?

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:05.660
Because I've stolen your 
smile from you, Professor.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.400
While I attended the Academy,

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:12.910
I admired and looked up 
to you, Professor Celia.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:18.600
Back then, Professor, you seemed 
so clearly happy, unlike now.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:24.030
Now, you're like a bird locked in a cage.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:30.880
If there were ever a chance for you to 
regain the smile you had back then...

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.500
<i>Princess Christina...</i>

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.010
I swear I will do everything in my 
power to help when the time comes.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:39.950
Thank you.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:47.020
And I will pray that you and 
Princess Flora will one day be reunited.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.680
It looks to be a lavish ceremony.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.350
Yes, it will be.

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:56.440
We should get going—

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.700
Alfred...

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:01.240
You are about to gloriously take command 
of the assembled forces, are you not?

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.810
After all, you are the strongest 
warrior in the kingdom.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:07.100
Your skills have caused some 
to call you the King's Sword.

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.500
But how unfortunate for you.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.640
I have authority over the 
security for the ceremony.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.900
You have no choice but to obey my orders.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:19.970
I only ever think of how 
I might fulfill my bounden duty.

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:23.890
Well, don't go showing off.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.790
Year one thousand of the Holy Era. Spring.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:33.420
<b>Year 1000 of the Holy Era, Spring</b>

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:36.400
Thus, the wedding ceremony between 
Professor Celia and Charles Arbor began.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:41.530
I can't see!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:41.530
Here they come!

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:45.530
They're nearly here!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.620
They're crossing the bridge!

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:48.230
I can see them!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:49.230
Here they come!

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.480
Amazing!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.510
That's a huge procession!

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:01.650
Oh, it's the bride!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.070
She's all silver...

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.560
Long live the Silver Bride!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.540
The Silver Bride!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.610
Long live the Silver Bride!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.440
I see. The Silver Bride, is it?

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.190
Coming from ignorant peasants, 
that's not a bad appellation.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.570
Well, it just shows how 
very beautiful you are.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.140
Th-Thank you.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:27.330
When I think that very soon you 
will be mine and mine alone...

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.750
I look forward to the moment 
we kiss to seal our oaths.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.490
Long live the House of Arbor!

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.920
Long live Lord Charles Arbor!

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:45.130
Long live the House of Arbor!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.640
Long live Lord Charles Arbor!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.890
Long live the House of Arbor!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.500
Long live Lord Charles Arbor!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.130
Long live the House of Arbor!

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.900
Long live the House of Arbor!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.960
One day, this kingdom will be mine.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.650
And you will be wife to me.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.580
Are they here yet?

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.260
Haruto, Celia is close.

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:27.920
It seems so.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.010
Haruto, you're very calm.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.020
It's thanks to you, Aishia.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.880
I only investigated. It wasn't very much.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:40.020
That's not true. Thanks to that,
 I understand a lot more.

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.670
It's the bride!

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:44.440
I see them!

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.340
She's so beautiful!

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.670
Long live the bride!

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.990
Long live the Silver Bride!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:55.170
Lord Charles! Lord Charles!

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.700
<i>Professor...</i>

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.240
<i>Haruto, I'm going to go now.</i>

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.210
Yes.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.230
<i>Celia?</i>

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.140
<i>Huh? What?</i>

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:03.710
<i>Celia, stay calm.</i>

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:04.890
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:06.440
<i>I'm Aishia.</i>

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>Haruto—no, Rio asked me 
to talk to you this way.</i>

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:12.420
<i>Rio did?</i>

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:13.720
<i>Look to your right.</i>

00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:18.940
<i>Rio...</i>

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:20.330
<i>Rio!</i>

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:22.590
<i>Why are you here?</i>

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>I told you not to come!</i>

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:29.750
<i>Rio, you were the one person 
I didn't want to see me like this!</i>

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:32.480
Hey, now! What's wrong, Celia?

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:34.170
Oh, I...

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:38.700
I'm not sure. So many feelings 
suddenly welled up...

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:43.410
I see. You're so happy you're crying? 
I didn't realize you cared for me so.

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:46.950
But we must be dignified here.

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.920
Everyone is watching, you see.

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:49.940
Yes.

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:50.550
Good.

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:00.210
<i>Aishia, can you hear me?</i>

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:03.310
<i>Where has Rio gone?</i>

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:09.960
<i>Was it... all a fantasy?</i>

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:16.640
Celia...

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:22.710
<i>I am... a doll.</i>

00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:26.920
Halt!

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:28.090
Hurry!

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.220
Seize him!

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:31.010
There's an intruder!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Time

